  "spec": "Mastery criteria",
  "rule": "A session passes when its value meets threshold under the comparator (>= or <=, boundary inclusive). 'consecutive' with window n needs the latest n sessions to all pass. 'best_of' with window n of m needs at least n passes among the latest m sessions, and m sessions must exist (MA-1). Fewer sessions than the window length means not mastered. prompt_ceiling (MA-2): a trial counts as correct only if it was correct at a prompt level at or below the ceiling (order: independent, gestural, verbal, model, partial_physical, full_physical); every trial stays in the denominator. across (MA-3): the passing sessions in the window must cover at least `across.count` different values of `across.kind` (setting, adult or material). maintenance (MA-4): re-probes are due 14 and 28 days after the mastery date; a day that is not a school day moves to the next school day.",
